<title>ISRAEL: Israel's June CPI +1.1 pct vs +0.5 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Israel's June CPI +1.1 pct vs +0.5 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator on Tuesday:</p>
<p>ISRAEL CONSUMER PRICES    June 97     May 97	June 96</p>
<p>Month-on-month change	+ 1.1	+ 0.5	  + 0.7</p>
<p>Year-on-year change	  + 8.4	+ 8.1	  +12.9</p>
<p>Index (base 100=1993)	150.2	148.6	  138.5</p>
<p>Note: To compare previous indices based on 1987=100.0, multiply indices from January 1994 by 2.421. R</p>
</text>
